{"id":"z02-38","volume":2,"volumeTitle":"周纪二","volumeSubtitle":"前323","index":38,"title":{"t":"顯王四十六年","s":"显王四十六年"},"book":{"t":"資治通鑑","s":"资治通鉴"},"sourceHead":{"t":"周紀二 · 前323 · 戊戌","s":"周纪二 · 前323 · 戊戌"},"author":"司马光","annotated":true,"paragraphs":[{"sentences":[{"tr":"秦国的张仪与齐国、楚国的相，在啮桑会面。","tokens":[{"t":"秦","s":"秦","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"張","s":"张","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"儀","s":"仪","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"及","s":"及","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"齊","s":"齐","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"楚","s":"楚","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"之","s":"之","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"相","s":"相","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"會","s":"会","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"嚙","s":"啮","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"桑","s":"桑","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]},{"sentences":[{"tr":"韩国和燕国都称起王来，唯独赵武灵王不愿意。他说：「实力够不上，哪敢占着这个名号？」","tokens":[{"t":"韓","s":"韩","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"、","s":"、","punct":true},{"t":"燕","s":"燕","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"皆","s":"皆","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"稱","s":"称","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"趙","s":"赵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"武","s":"武","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"靈","s":"灵","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"王","s":"王","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"獨","s":"独","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"不","s":"不","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"肯","s":"肯","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"曰","s":"曰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"：","s":"：","punct":true},{"t":"「","s":"「","punct":true},{"t":"無","s":"无","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"實","s":"实","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"，","s":"，","punct":true},{"t":"敢","s":"敢","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"處","s":"处","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"其","s":"其","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"名","s":"名","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"乎","s":"乎","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"？","s":"？","punct":true},{"t":"」","s":"」","punct":true}]},{"tr":"他吩咐国中的人，称呼自己为君。","tokens":[{"t":"令","s":"令","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"國","s":"国","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"人","s":"人","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"謂","s":"谓","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"己","s":"己","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"曰","s":"曰","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"君","s":"君","py":"","ctx":"","pos":"","extra":"","level":"dict"},{"t":"。","s":"。","punct":true}]}]}],"lesson":{"background":"周显王四十六年，是公元前323年。秦相张仪和齐、楚两国的相在啮桑见面。就在这一年，韩、燕改称王号，赵国君主赵雍却认为自己没有与王相称的力量，不肯称王，只让国人叫他君。史书用他后来的谥号，称他赵武灵王。","theme":"这一年要记住的是名和实。别国已经称王，赵武灵王却先问自己有没有王的实力。他不肯空占王号，把称呼停在君上。在诸侯纷纷抬高名号的时候，他用这一问把称号和力量分开了。","technique":"司马光这一年写得很短，三句话记两件事，没有臣光曰。会盟只留一个地名，赵武灵王的态度则放在他自己的反问里。「无其实，敢处其名乎」一句，就把他不肯称王的理由说完了。","keyContentWords":[{"word":"啮桑","reading":"niè sāng","note":"地名。张仪与齐、楚两国之相在这里会面。"},{"word":"称王","reading":"chēng wáng","note":"自称为王。韩、燕这一年放弃原来的爵称，改用王号。"},{"word":"武灵王","reading":"wǔ líng wáng","note":"赵君后来的谥号。史书用这个称呼写他，当时他自己不许国人称王。"}],"keyFunctionWords":[{"word":"及","reading":"jí","note":"连词，相当于和，把张仪与齐、楚之相连在一起。"},{"word":"独","reading":"dú","note":"范围副词，只有、偏偏。韩、燕都称王，只有赵武灵王不肯。"},{"word":"乎","reading":"hū","note":"句末疑问语气词，帮助构成反问，相当于吗。"}],"ancientModern":[{"word":"其实","reading":"qí shí","note":"这里是它的实质，指与王号相配的力量。不能读成现代汉语里表示转折的其实。"}],"phoneticLoans":[],"flexibleUsage":[],"specialSyntax":[{"name":"反问句","note":"「无其实，敢处其名乎」表面是问，实际是否定：没有实力，就不敢占据王这个名号。"}]}}
